**Claim 1.** A memory device comprising:

a plurality of bank groups;

a first bus and a second bus;

a toggle signal generator configured to produce a first toggle signal and a second toggle signal that are complementary to each other, the first and second toggle signals being configured to select one of the first bus and the second bus; and

a command/address transmission unit configured to transmit a read command, a write command, and a column address to the selected one of the first bus and the second bus in response to the first and second toggle signals.
